Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.64,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,687)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 10:43 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.46,0:00:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Kinoto, the architect you spoke\Non the phone with earlier today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here to assess the fire\Nrestoration and renovation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did agree to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.78,0:00:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in store! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My apologies for the forceful\Ngreeting, but one has to be cautious.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.34,0:00:35.22,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: "Yay! I got work! Gonna make some money! Kishibe Rohan seems rich, so I'm gonna make bank off him. Hopefully I can overcharge him a bit."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see, born a 1970 top-notch\Narchitect named Masazo Kinoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's definitely the one I called for\Nrepairs, and he doesn't seem to be a threat.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.81,0:00:43.02,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: "I don't like anyone looking at my back."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:50.19,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: "I won't let anyone see my back. I don't have acne, scars, or a tattoo,\N but I never want anyone to see my back! I wish I had a girlfriend. What should I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.30,0:00:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then again, no one's without\Ntheir bizarre fears and phobias.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.68,0:00:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, he seems safe\Nenough to let into the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though that Ro-sham brat\Nalso seemed innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A simple command of I can't attack\NRohan should suffice for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.74,0:01:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.98,0:01:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I just make a faux pas?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.46,0:01:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.56,0:01:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come in and we'll talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.78,0:01:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a lot to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.42,0:01:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most of the damage is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.32,0:01:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't perform a proper\Nassessment from out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.34,0:01:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right behind you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, where is that room?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.74,0:01:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to see it.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.49,0:01:43.95,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,680)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 9:06 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think my escape\Nwould go so smoothly.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.25,0:01:46.83,Main,Toyohiro,0,0,0,,{\an8}Of course I'll get away! It's simple. {This line and the next are in episode 31 and updated for blu-rays}
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.33,0:01:48.92,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(141,890)\fs60}Episode 32: {\fs80} July 15th (Thursday), Part 2
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.33,0:01:48.92,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,513)\pos(141,890)\fs60}Episode 32: {\fs80} July 15th (Thursday) Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I shouldn't be surprised.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.33,0:01:52.25,Main,Toyohiro,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's not like you guys have found Kira Yoshikage yet, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't even caught\NYoshikage Kira yet, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.42,0:01:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did it ever cross your mind\Nthat my name might be fake?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.42,0:02:00.68,Note,Toyohiro,0,0,0,,Note: His name is a reference to the transmission tower
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:01:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or that I could maybe be wearing a mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:02:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does the name Kanedaichi sound real? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's a fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.44,0:02:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you've been wearing\Na gaudy mask all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leaving this place has been my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.76,0:02:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you really think I'd do\Nit without a clean escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.62,0:02:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I definitely wouldn't wanna be ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Get back here! No, Mr.\NJosuke! Don't come in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.28,0:02:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall remain in the tower for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.56,0:02:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.47,0:02:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way we're leaving you in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're only in this situation\Nbecause I discovered the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.52,0:02:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for this,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.43,0:02:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's my fault for deciding to turn\Ninto the power line and climb up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.76,0:02:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only wanted to be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.02,0:02:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to change your opinion\Nand for you to be proud of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.90,0:02:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have just listened to Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.82,0:02:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have stayed out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.34,0:02:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't trouble yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.86,0:02:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am used to the inside of a spaceship,\Nso this is really quite nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.32,0:02:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a weird one but\Nyou've got a lion's heart
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.06,0:02:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though to be frank I\Nhonestly don't give a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:02:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who remains trapped in\Nhere as long as I walk
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,free I'm a happy man what\Nyou fools do after that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.94,0:03:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is oh No you're a permanent\Nresident I remember
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.22,0:03:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you saying something\Nabout not wanting to be us
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.70,0:03:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I'm done nobody in their right mind
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.44,0:03:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will want to be you\Nwhat why just a piss off
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.56,0:03:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you cutting this line, I was\Nable to fix it and get myself up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.74,0:03:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mikitaka, give me about ten\Nseconds and I'll have you free.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I put this bro hole\Nback in his douche cage,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.78,0:03:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll heal you up and it'll\Nbe like this never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.48,0:03:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful up there, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.40,0:03:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, as if.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.48,0:03:42.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Props, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.48,0:03:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mending the wire to swing\Nup here was ingenious,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.10,0:03:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but coming back to this tower was not\Nthe smartest move you could have made.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.50,0:03:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have been perfectly\Ncontent leaving this place behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.24,0:03:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, killing you pig-headed\Nboobs never crossed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.26,0:03:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you just had to go and force my act!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.02,0:04:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now for me to make my getaway,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no other choice but\Nto push you to your death!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.98,0:04:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.24,0:04:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.22,0:04:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now that I see your shining diamond up\Nclose, it's actually pretty damn impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.12,0:04:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, you can't really think\Nyou'd stand a chance against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.80,0:04:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could prance around the top of\Nthis tower with my eyes closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.26,0:04:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm guessing your stance\Nrange is about two meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.34,0:04:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.74,0:04:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw you, dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.32,0:04:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.76,0:04:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:04:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, you have to move now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He already slashed the\Ntower with his knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.26,0:05:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.17,0:05:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He carved slits into the beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a real low blow, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.40,0:05:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though to be fair, as\Nfast as your attacks are,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.92,0:05:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my shining diamond won't\Neven break a sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep smirking, Preak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.92,0:05:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see if you're\Nstill wearing that smile
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after the ass-whooping\NI'm about to give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.74,0:05:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know every centimeter of this\Ntower like the back of my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you loudmouthed shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.98,0:05:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also know precisely\Nwhich angle to cut to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.44,0:05:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,send the projectile in\Nthe direction I desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a pool shark who's bored\Nwith his own mastery of the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.50,0:05:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know all the moves! Pool shark?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.06,0:05:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you just say my\Nattacks weren't fast
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enough to make Shining\NDiamond break a sweat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see if that holds true if you\Ndon't know where they're coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.34,0:05:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, how many shots did I fire back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.40,0:06:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're ricocheting off\Nthe beams as I speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.56,0:06:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, they're coming for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.80,0:06:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.71,0:06:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.22,0:06:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.08,0:06:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you coming\Nup here was a dumb move?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.06,0:06:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially after your\Nalien friend had the balls
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.18,0:06:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to say you'd stay behind\Nand cover your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only you'd have listened to him, at\Nthe very least you could have lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.52,0:06:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not both of his arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.46,0:06:32.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he can\Ndodge another attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.98,0:06:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the time's come\Nfor the finishing blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.74,0:06:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll - Hey\NOkuyasu, question for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.68,0:06:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw this guy's\Nprojectile thingies, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you catch how many of my knocked\Naway with my shining diamonds?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.24,0:06:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm cooking up something
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.83,0:06:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw the whole thing you definitely\Nmanaged to land a hit on four
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.22,0:06:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of those suckers How the hell can you\Nbe so nonchalant four of them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that should be plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.76,0:07:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only need four shots to take\Nyou down What are you blathering
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.84,0:07:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on about if I'm remembering right\Nyou use the word ricochet? Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.98,0:07:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's right You said your stand's energy\Nricocheted around like billiard balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.94,0:07:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that is what you said, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.20,0:07:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.11,0:07:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.86,0:07:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By now, you know my stand\Nis called Shining Diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But did the old fart in the\Nphoto let you in on the fact
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that it can correct destroyed\Nmatter and fractured energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.36,0:07:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he did, maybe he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what's that got to do\Nwith your current predicament?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really telling me you had the\Ntime to correct something just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.12,0:07:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of fool do you take me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.64,0:07:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He corrected the energy\Nricocheting between the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.94,0:07:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,beams so that it would\Nreturn to the slash steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.43,0:07:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, I thought that you were done\Nfor, but you had already won this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.38,0:07:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you pull that off?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said coming up here was a dumb move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.44,0:07:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think of my plan now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Streaming
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me The whole\Nreason I started living in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this godforsaken tower was\Nto get away from other people
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.32,0:08:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that cranky old guy in\Nthe photograph convinced
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.26,0:08:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me to trap a stand user He\Nsaid if I could just do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'd make sure I'd be\Nable to have a life in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the outside world So\NI decided to go for it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please go easy on me\NI'm begin' you If you'd
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let me go back inside\Nthe safety of my tower,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.82,0:08:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never want to leave home again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.70,0:08:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let me stay between these beams.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.84,0:08:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll live out the rest\Nof my life in peace and quiet.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.61,0:08:34.91,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}New Morioh Landmark: The Man Living on the Transmission Tower.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.61,0:08:46.38,Episode 32 Caption,Sign,0,0,0,,{\be18\pos(1397.333,771.333)}Morioh Landmark #9 \NThe Man Living on the Transmission Tower
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.00,0:08:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New Mariah Landmark, the\Nman in the electrical tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a marvel of self-sufficiency.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.91,0:08:41.54,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}Bringing him salt or snacks will make him more than happy to take pictures with you, despite his preference to remain in solitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.82,0:08:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you bring him a\Nbit of salt or snacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he'll be happy to let you take a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.44,0:08:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't expect him to\Nbe able to muster up the
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.54,0:08:46.38,Narrator,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\an8}He's a bit shy, which is why he wears \Na mask and keeps his real name a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.44,0:08:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,courage to take off his mask\Nor divulge his real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.48,0:08:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.68,0:08:49.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But tell us more about the old guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he tell you anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.96,0:08:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like the whereabouts of\Nhis son Yoshikage Kira.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.86,0:08:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything would help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:08:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, he did\Nmention a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.96,0:09:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think his name was Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What else do you know about Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.64,0:09:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, take it easy, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.18,0:09:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The geyser and I were just\Nhaving some casual conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He barely even mentioned him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The subject never came up again,\Nso he didn't think to ask anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.42,0:09:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he didn't elaborate\Non who the guy was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.46,0:09:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get to the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.62,0:09:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did he say about Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.40,0:09:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he told me that he\Nfound a way to eliminate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said he got rid of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.46,0:09:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if his son's Yoshikage Kira,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.74,0:09:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it seems like the old man\Nmight have already caught up to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.80,0:09:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said from now on, he would do\Nmore than just protect his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd start seeking out\Nand attacking his enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then he told me that a\Nrecently created stand user
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.78,0:09:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eliminated a user named\NKoichi just this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.56,0:09:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's all, I swear.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.14,0:09:47.65,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,750)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 10:58 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.74,0:09:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, and this would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.54,0:09:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, goodness, look at this door!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.06,0:09:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This'll be about 800,000 yen by itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.54,0:09:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And these designs are from the\NVictorian or Edwardian era,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.32,0:09:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they even use English-made materials!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.68,0:10:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is going to be a Days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he doesn't want anyone\Nlooking at his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.62,0:10:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose that could explain his rather\Nodd behavior when he first arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.50,0:10:14.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before it gets cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.84,0:10:22.56,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,650)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 11:16 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.90,0:10:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's not the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.16,0:10:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must resist.
