Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.00,0:10:51.50,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,516)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 10:20 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.52,0:10:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AAAAAAAAHHHHHHHHH?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.68,0:10:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AAAAAH?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.59,0:10:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.51,0:11:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really hope that they\Nfind Koichi safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.42,0:11:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.01,0:11:08.48,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,650)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 11:37 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.66,0:11:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah! Gah! Gah! Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.60,0:11:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah! GAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.62,0:11:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't find him at home or at school!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.60,0:11:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.72,0:11:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi! Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.32,0:11:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving up, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna do whatever it\Ntakes to find you, Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.16,0:11:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the long and the short of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.24,0:11:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanna know if you're willing\Nto get off your ass and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.86,0:11:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,help me find Koichi with\Nyour scent-tracking ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.12,0:11:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuya Fungami.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.22,0:11:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do, I'll get rid of your injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.92,0:11:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.54,0:11:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say it once, understand—don't\Nyou mess with me, Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.90,0:11:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't play around and I\Nwon't forgive you for attacking
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.02,0:11:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,me like a savage and\Nlanding me back in this bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.46,0:11:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What makes you think I you you Fungami\Nwould sacrifice my pride to help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.58,0:12:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're turning me down, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.38,0:12:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kind of figured this would\Nbe a long shot Well, see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.28,0:12:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm short on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.34,0:12:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.56,0:12:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're gonna leave just\Nlike that Hey, would you wait a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.52,0:12:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't even given me the\Nchance to bargain Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.90,0:12:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.16,0:12:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help you find your little friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.12,0:12:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like I actually\Nhave a choice in the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.66,0:12:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I could hold out\Nfor a better bargain,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but then I'd just be stuck\Nin this dump even longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.60,0:12:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't give my girls the kind of\Nattention they deserve while I'm like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.82,0:12:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and for all I know, they could be\Non their way out of my life forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.78,0:12:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so horrible, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, the accident that got me\Ninto this whole mess is my own doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.24,0:12:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.16,0:12:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, can you hurry up and\Nget to the healing already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.48,0:12:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These injuries are driving me insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.54,0:12:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit your complaining!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.04,0:12:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shining Diamond!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.98,0:12:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Already reversed your injuries?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.08,0:12:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's that gorgeous face!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.90,0:13:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a stunningly beautiful\Ncreature, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.52,0:13:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the very least!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.76,0:13:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I'm one of Michelangelo's\Nsculptures come to life,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but now that I'm getting a better look?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I think my eyes\Nare slightly droopier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your stand can actually\Nfix things 100%, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Count your blessings, douche!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.94,0:13:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now stop preening in the mirror and tell\Nme how well your sense of smell works!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.66,0:13:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.80,0:13:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't promise I'd be as good as a\Ntrained hunting dog or anything, but...
