Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.36,0:13:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.64,0:13:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For example, I can tell that there are\Nthree girls walking up the hall right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.14,0:13:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It smells like Rock, Akemi, and Yoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.26,0:13:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're my fangirls, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Based on their scent, they're\Ncoming back from the pachinko place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.74,0:13:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, babe, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, baby, you're out of\Nthat icky hospital bed! Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.32,0:13:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, baby, you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.24,0:13:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, sweetie!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, there, everything's fine, vixens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:13:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Josuke, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.74,0:14:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna get skewered right here and now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.72,0:14:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.82,0:14:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hold no ill will toward him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.58,0:14:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, more importantly, you gals just\Ngot back from Pachinko, yeah? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the world did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.12,0:14:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because all of your\Nskirts reek of ass sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why else would you be planting those\Nsupple cheeks on vinyl chairs for so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, Akemi, you got any chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanted Pachinko, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.86,0:14:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're amazing, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.46,0:14:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, we brought you a souvenir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.62,0:14:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now do you see, Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.58,0:14:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am who I am thanks to these\Nlovely dames in my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I can hold\Nthem again, so I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.10,0:14:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you weren't as\Ngood as a hunting dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.56,0:14:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as far as I'm concerned,\Nyou're even better.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.27,0:14:45.65,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,600)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 12:05 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.64,0:14:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm aware that the upstairs floor\Nsustained fire damage as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll perform the estimates,\Nso please go ahead without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.46,0:14:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this man doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why's he so obsessed with hiding his back?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:14:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'll happen if I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could I not want to\Nlook after that display?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.18,0:15:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I have to trick him, then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.36,0:15:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, how annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.52,0:15:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so itchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.92,0:15:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only there was some way or\Nother, I could reach this itch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.86,0:15:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it would be quite rude of me to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ask a person I just met\Nto scratch it for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.14,0:15:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.14,0:15:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I don't mind helping.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.28,0:15:35.70,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,453)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 12:38 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.26,0:15:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, this is the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.78,0:15:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found Koichi's bag lying right\Nhere in the open with no explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.62,0:15:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His house is only about two\Nminutes up the road there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.62,0:15:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did this new stand user\Nstorm Koichi and snatch
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:50.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him away from a busy street\Nfirst thing in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody should have seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chosuke, our little deal doesn't\Ninclude me fighting, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.84,0:16:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because when I agreed to come here, I was\Ntold that I'd only be used for tracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.64,0:16:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't feel comfortable proceeding until\Nyou tell me I won't be fighting anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.06,0:16:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why bring something like\Nthat up at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.20,0:16:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because somebody's been tailing you. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.58,0:16:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that man over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.42,0:16:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.82,0:16:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I smell Koichi's scent on that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.78,0:16:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.72,0:16:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have something on\Nhim that belongs to Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.58,0:16:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.04,0:16:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the guy we're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.60,0:16:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.62,0:16:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.16,0:16:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you did with\NKoichi, you kidnapping bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.36,0:16:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.64,0:16:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's definitely Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's out cold, but she's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.32,0:17:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was watching from here and still\Ndon't have a clue what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.28,0:17:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did he change into Josuke's mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.58,0:17:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard Jotaro can stop\Ntime for a couple seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this is a new level\Nof timey-wimey bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even Jotaro wouldn't\Nbe able to quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,swap out one person\Nwith another like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.20,0:17:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he had just come out and hit me, I\Nwould have been fine with knocking him out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.04,0:17:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,grabbing Koichi, and calling it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.32,0:17:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that bastard went after my mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.94,0:17:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scum like him needs to be punished!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.08,0:17:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This scheming scumbag is going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yuya!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.91,0:17:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's that piece of shit hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.28,0:17:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make him pay for what he's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.82,0:17:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how the hell would I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were touching the guy\Nand managed to lose him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.74,0:17:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still here, Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.84,0:17:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still picking up a\Ntrace of his scent nearby!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.70,0:17:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.61,0:17:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuya Fungami, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knew a simple nose\Nwould be such a nuisance?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.32,0:17:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never dreamed these fools\Nwould sniff me out, as it were.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.28,0:17:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, releasing Josuke's\Nmother was all part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:17:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The perfect plan to observe Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.58,0:18:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Observation. That's what my\NStand, Mysterioso, excels at.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.08,0:18:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,does best mysterioso meticulously observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.90,0:18:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi Hirose's movements as well as your
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mother's that boy really pisses me off
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.19,0:18:16.61,Episode 31 Times,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,495)\pos(960,785)}July 15th (Thursday) 7:37 AM
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.62,0:18:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to his that Josuke
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he is home after all show yourself.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.34,0:18:40.59,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: "Your panties"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.82,0:18:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one in the world is\Nimmune to fear. You really
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.80,0:18:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shouldn't hide the glow of\Nfear or the tremors of dread
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.66,0:18:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a kind of fear that\Nlies deep within the soul no
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.82,0:18:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,matter what you do it could\NYou'll never be wiped away,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.56,0:19:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.74,0:19:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.98,0:19:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you get into my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.24,0:19:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to my observations,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.40,0:19:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you tend to swallow your saliva?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when gripped with the\Nequalizer of unyielding fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All people exhibit certain unconscious\Nbehaviors when in a state of panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Certain terror-induced quirks\Ncome swirling to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.86,0:19:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know about yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.94,0:19:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you're a robber or\Nwhat, but I'm not giving you any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.32,0:19:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So get the hell out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.76,0:19:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I look like a common burglar?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.70,0:19:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.02,0:19:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, it feels like\NI should be paying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.68,0:19:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm having quite the\Nexhilarating morning, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.28,0:19:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being the recipient of so much\Nattention is such a lovely treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The attention you're showering me\Nwith out of fear is simply wonderful.
