Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.48,0:19:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.70,0:20:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like you just swallowed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you see. I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.14,0:20:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet another swallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.44,0:20:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that really is the\Ntelltale sign of your fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once I discover your\Nprecious mark of fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.98,0:20:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my Mysterioso comes alive and\Nunleashes its invincible onslaught!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.96,0:20:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've transformed Tomoko\NHigashikata and Koichi
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.46,0:20:51.81,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: Higashikata Tomoko, Hirose Koichi
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.04,0:20:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hirose into paper with hardly any effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.50,0:20:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I startled Koichi\Non his way to school,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.22,0:20:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I discovered his mark of\Nfear as a double blink,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.66,0:20:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an obvious tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.28,0:20:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.19,0:20:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the last time, where\Nis the scent coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.52,0:20:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I imagined,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.84,0:20:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,regardless of Josuke's tough exterior,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.76,0:21:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plopping his mother before his eyes\Nwould certainly stir up pangs of dread.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.96,0:21:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, there was\NJosuke's very own mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he experiences fear, he\Nanxiously bites his lower lip!
