Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.14,0:21:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The user.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it possible he's inside her jacket?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.34,0:21:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what kind of stand it is, I\Nneed to know what's inside this pocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.34,0:21:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is he gonna bite his lip?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.64,0:21:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.84,0:21:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuya, answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.30,0:21:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he here or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.72,0:21:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, fear hasn't consumed him yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.94,0:21:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been over this, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.90,0:21:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never promised to help\Nyou fight any enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only agreed that I'd track him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anymore, and I'd be risking my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.80,0:21:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I only said I'd\Nhelp because you healed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.42,0:21:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way in hell I'm going down as
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.18,0:21:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that dumbass who walks\Nright into harm's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.56,0:22:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to disappoint you,\Nbut this guy freaks me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.50,0:22:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll check for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.78,0:22:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.69,0:22:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both pockets are empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.61,0:22:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Other than this piece of paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.66,0:22:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The scent's out of the pocket now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.38,0:22:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.36,0:22:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.54,0:22:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you know what's good for you,\Nyou'll keep that piece of paper closed.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.88,0:22:52.26,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.26,0:22:54.51,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.51,0:22:57.31,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.31,0:22:58.98,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.98,0:23:01.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.35,0:23:03.73,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
